1. Simplified Chinese Localization Engine & Dictionaries
   - Derived from and enhanced upon `Silas-02/antigravity-desktop-cn`
     (https://github.com/Silas-02/antigravity-desktop-cn), originally forked
     from `qqxpee/antigravity2-cn` (https://github.com/qqxpee/antigravity2-cn).
   - Sincere thanks to Silas-02 and qqxpee for their foundational localization
     architecture and dictionary curation.

2. Built-in Context Pro Telemetry & Swarm Radar (`plugins/desktop-context`)
   - Built upon the foundational architecture created by Dimitrios Ioannidis in
     `dimitr-io/antigravity-desktop-context`
